HOW TO CREATE MULTIPLE FOLDERS

mkdir sa{1..50}
mkdir -p sa{1..50}/sax{1..50}
mkdir {a-z}12345 
mkdir {1,2,3}
mkdir test{01..10}
mkdir -p `date '+%y%m%d'`/{1,2,3} 
mkdir -p $USER/{1,2,3}


HOW TO CREATE MULTIPLE FOLDERS INSIDE SUB-FOLDERS

for dir in path/to/folder/*/ path/to/folder2/*/; do touch "$dir/filename"; done